        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Following Gilead’s exercise of its option for each program, we may opt-in to cover 40% of the research and development costs in the United States and share 40% of the profits and operating loss in the United States for products within the program in lieu of receiving milestones and royalties for that program in the United States, unless we later opt out of the cost/profit share for the program.",
